  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 916ca174c9f91bc47ab29cda8fbdcf0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: Memory_bowl
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MemoryData
  openingLine: This reminds me of...
  lines:
  - Oh Luna, she was here before I was even born.
  - Every time I dropped food at dinner, she was already under the table waiting.
  - "When she got too old for the stairs, I slept on the couch so she wouldn\u2019t
    be alone."
  - She still thumped her tail every time I said her name.
  - "I don\u2019t think I ever filled this bowl without her watching me do it."
  - It's been empty for such a long time now.
